  "href": "extensive_game/equilibrium/extensive_game_equilibrium_weak_bayesian_perfect_equilibrium.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Weak Bayesian Perfect Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>A pair $(\\beta,\\mu)$ of a behavioral strategy profile and a belief system is weak\nBayesian perfect if:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>at every information set $Q_i$, $\\beta_i(Q_i)$ is a best response in the\n   continuation game starting at $Q_i$ under belief $\\mu(Q_i)$ and continuation\n   play $\\beta$;</li>\n<li>on every reached information set $Q\\in Rch(\\beta)$, beliefs are Bayes-compatible:\n   $$\n     \\mu(Q)=\\nu_\\beta(Q).\n   $$</li>\n</ol>",
  "proof_html": null,
